    <briefdescription>
<para>Normalised aerodynamic force coefficients derived from GPU force integrals. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Extends <ref refid="classNeoFOAM_1_1Forces" kindref="compound">Forces</ref> by dividing the raw pressure forces and moments by the dynamic pressure reference quantities to produce dimensionless coefficients.</para>
<para>Registered as <computeroutput>neoForceCoeffs</computeroutput> in OpenFOAM&apos;s runtime selection table: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">functions</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>aeroCoeffs</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="classNeoFOAM_1_1ForceCoeffs_1a8fdde200ae77b634953cf6ffe11f14bf" kindref="member">type</ref><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>neoForceCoeffs;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>libs<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>(<ref refid="namespaceNeoFOAM" kindref="compound">NeoFOAM</ref>);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>patches<sp/><sp/><sp/>(wing);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>pName<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>p;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>rhoInf<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>1.225;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>pRef<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>0.0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>magUInf<sp/><sp/><sp/>30.0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>lRef<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>1.0;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>Aref<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>0.5;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>CofR<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>(0<sp/>0<sp/>0);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Output columns (forceCoeffs.dat)</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="preprocessor">#<sp/>Time<sp/><sp/>Cd.x<sp/><sp/>Cd.y<sp/><sp/>Cd.z<sp/><sp/>Cm.x<sp/><sp/>Cm.y<sp/><sp/>Cm.z</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> where <computeroutput>Cd</computeroutput> = pressureForce / (0.5 * rhoInf * magUInf² * Aref) and <computeroutput>Cm</computeroutput> = pressureMoment / (0.5 * rhoInf * magUInf² * Aref * lRef).</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Viscous force contributions are zero in v1. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>MPI parallel execution is not yet supported. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
